  "solution": {
    "text": "From the given information we can conclude <br/><math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> , So, <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi></math>  <br/>And <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/>Also, <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/>So, <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mi>S</mi></math>  <br/>Hence, <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is not true."
  }
